cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "SOCC-Bench: small and occluded object detection from a low-altitude UAV"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark in which target scale and occlusion are physically staged during
  capture and measured afterwards, with a pre-registered, seed-paired evaluation
  of architectural, paradigm, data-regime and inference-time remedies for
  small-object detection.
type: software
authors:
